  1019	
  1020	# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  1021	# TRANSITIONAL — DELETE IN SLICE 5.
  1022	#
  1023	# Lineage-keying leaves exactly one hole: wholesale replacement. A store
  1024	# rewritten with a NEW lineage finds no journal, is classified first contact,
  1025	# and is trusted on sight — §07's "replacement or explicit re-custody" row
  1026	# passing silently. Detecting it requires knowing which lineage a location
  1027	# SHOULD present, and architecturally that is `StoreDescriptor.lineage`
  1028	# ("when already known, is checked against genesis rather than trusted as a
