  1030	# forcing consumer named as slice 5's adopt ceremony, and growing the `.vertex`
  1031	# grammar out of sequence here would take a decision slice 3 was not given.
  1032	#
  1033	# So the binding lives here until the declared lineage supersedes it. Its
  1034	# deletion is a residue sweep, not a behavior change: once every store's
  1035	# vertex declares its lineage, `descriptor.lineage` answers every question
  1036	# this file answers, from a source the operator can read and review. Slice 5
  1037	# deletes this section, `bindings.jsonl`, and its tests together — the same
  1038	# obligation `arrival_registry`'s transitional inference arm carries.
  1039	# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
